    {
      "name": "Psychic Shuffle",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "reaction",
        "description": "<p>When the PCs take a long rest, you can <strong>spend a Fear</strong> to swap their psyches. Collect all the players' character sheets, then shuffle and randomly redistribute them. Each character sheet comes with that PC's Domain cards and player aids. A PC can regain their psyche with a successful Knowledge Roll, at which point they trade sheets with the player who has their original character sheet.</p><section id=\"secret-bXSAzjDUhEMAtZSv\" class=\"secret\"><p>How does it feel being in someone else's skin? If you could choose to stay like them in one way, what would it be?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
        "gmNotes": "",
        "resource": null,
